      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
           "text": "@Andrew Woods"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ": the wiki page with better information for setting up Camel is:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Setup+Camel+Message+Integrations"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Setup+Camel+Message+Integrations",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "That page has info on setting up Karaf, as well as deploying Camel packages to a servlet container.  So that seems like the best documentation to follow for the vagrant work, though we'll need to update it with the newly-added header info too.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
